# Production build defaults (Next.js loads this during `next build`).
#
# Strict Clerk authentication: the middleware enforces auth on protected
# routes (unauthenticated -> /sign-in), the landing page exposes no
# anonymous dashboard, and logout returns to /sign-in.
#
# NO SECRETS HERE. NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the client bundle
# at build time, so this file must contain only non-secret configuration.
# The Clerk publishable key (NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY) and all
# secret keys are set as environment variables in the Vercel dashboard.
#
# NOTE: an explicit NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_MODE set in the Vercel dashboard would
# override this file — leave it unset there so this committed value applies.
NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_MODE=clerk
